              <description>Any unit of Bulgar Foot Warriors may be upgraded to Later Warriors (+1 pt, Leadership 5); Later Warriors do not count as Light Infantry. Warriors and Later Warriors may deploy behind a Palisade Fence (see the Balkan Ruse special rule).</description>
