              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Text" typeId="63ac-8f60-d28a-2232">Hand weapon, javelins and buckler. May have shield instead of buckler (+1 pt), and throwing spear (+1 pt). Nobles may have light armour (+2 pts). Skirmishers. Feigned Flight. If Nobles are taken, at least one unit of Slav Cavalry must be taken also. 0-3 units. Early Balkan Slav armies may choose one unit of Slav Nobles; Slav Nobles may not be chosen in Bulgar armies. (Byzantium p.75)</characteristic>
