              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Text" typeId="63ac-8f60-d28a-2232">Hand weapon, javelins and buckler. May have shield instead of buckler (+1 pt), and throwing spear (+1 pt). Skirmishers. Feigned Flight. Only the wealthiest Slav warriors fought from horseback. While the elusive cavalrymen of the Slavic tribes were a taxing opponent, the mainstay of Slavic warbands fought on foot. (Byzantium p.75)</characteristic>
